    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">MPL201 · Chapter 12 · Session 18</span>\n<h2>Session 18 — Chapter 7: Segmenting and Targeting the Audience (Supplementary Textbook)</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 13469 · session plan</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">MPL201 · Chương 12 · Buổi 18</span>\n<h2>Buổi 18 — Chapter 7: Segmenting and Targeting the Audience (Supplementary Textbook)</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 13469 · kế hoạch buổi</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO2<br><br>CLO2, CLO6</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">U</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slides in this lesson</span><span class=\"v\">none from FLM</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Hình thức</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO2<br><br>CLO2, CLO6</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">U</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slide trong bài</span><span class=\"v\">FLM không có</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>What this session covers (FLM, verbatim)</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nội dung buổi học (FLM, nguyên văn)</h3></div>\n<p>Chapter 7: Segmenting and Targeting the Audience (Supplementary Textbook)<br>- How do we segment markets and target audiences? (Segmentation strategies; types of segmentation; targeting the best audiences)<br><br>In-class Activity: Applying AI for Customer Analysis &amp; Persona Development</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Materials to read</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Tài liệu cần đọc</h3></div>\n<p>1. Main textbook: Advertising Media Planning: A Brand Management Approach<br>Chapter 11: P.54-67<br>2. Supplementary Textbook: Advertising &amp; IMC: Principles &amp; Practice. P.226<br>2. Any other resources recommended by the lecturer</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Student's tasks</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nhiệm vụ sinh viên</h3></div>\n<p>Participate actively in class (ask and answer questions)<br>Read the syllabus and textbooks.<br><br>Apply lesson knowledge and AI tools to complete the assignment and present it in class.</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Detailed lecture and 🎬 video for this session: coming later. For now follow the slides, the materials and the tasks above.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Bài giảng chi tiết và 🎬 video cho buổi này: sẽ bổ sung sau. Trước mắt học theo slide, tài liệu và nhiệm vụ ở trên.</div></div>"
